WEBVTT

00:00:56.905 --> 00:01:01.382
and stopped just beneath the eyes.

00:01:01.382 --> 00:01:03.553
He never lost consciousness.

00:01:03.553 --> 00:01:06.140
Rather, he watched from within

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:08.446
as his body shut down,

00:01:08.446 --> 00:01:10.583
limb by limb,

00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:13.542
muscle by muscle.

00:01:13.542 --> 00:01:18.100
In that ICU room, I walked up to my father's body,

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:21.699
and with a quivering voice and through tears,

00:01:21.699 --> 00:01:25.112
I began reciting the alphabet.

00:01:25.112 --> 00:01:31.010
A, B, C, D, E, F, G,